      "signature": "uint HasCharTypePunctuation(uint dwChar)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Checks if a character has the punctuation type flag (0x8).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If locale mode > 1, delegate to extended lookup via FUN_6fc452c7\n2. Otherwise, look up character in g_pwCharTypeTable and mask with 0x8\n\nParameters:\n- wChar (uint): Unicode character code point to check\n\nReturns:\n- Non-zero if character has punctuation flag, 0 otherwise\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8: CT_PUNCT flag from Windows character type table",
