      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Unlocks CRT critical section 9 (heap lock) and clears EDI register.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push 9 as critical section index\n2. Call UnlockCrtCriticalSection\n3. Clear EDI to 0 (caller uses as null result)\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void (but EDI is zeroed as side effect)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- LockCrtCriticalSection: Acquires the critical section\n- ReallocWithHeapStrategy: Primary caller after heap operations",
