      "name": "LockFileOrCrtCriticalSection",
      "signature": "void LockFileOrCrtCriticalSection(int nLockIndex, FILE * pFile)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Acquires critical section lock for file I/O or CRT internal synchronization.\nUses different lock strategies based on lock index threshold.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compare nLockIndex against threshold 0x14 (20)\n2. If nLockIndex less than 0x14, use CRT internal critical section\n   - Call LockCrtCriticalSection with offset nLockIndex + 0x1C\n3. If nLockIndex greater or equal to 0x14, use per-file critical section\n   - Enter CRITICAL_SECTION embedded in file struct at pFile + 0x20\n\nParameters:\n- nLockIndex (int): Lock index determining lock type\n- pFile (FILE*): File structure pointer for per-file locks\n\nReturns:\n- void (holds critical section lock on return)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x14 (20): Threshold between CRT table and file locks\n- 0x1C (28): Offset for CRT critical section index\n- 0x20 (32): Offset to CRITICAL_SECTION in file structure",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:2221715ad392d22929a667a9021e3f90",
