      "name": "ConsumeVarargWord",
      "signature": "ushort ConsumeVarargWord(uint * * ppdwArgs)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "ushort",
      "comment": "Consumes a 16-bit value from varargs and advances pointer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Advance varargs pointer by 4 bytes (stack alignment)\n2. Read 16-bit value from previous position (offset -4)\n3. Return value zero-extended to 32-bit\n\nParameters:\n- ppdwArgs (uint**): Pointer to varargs pointer\n\nReturns:\n- 16-bit value from varargs as ushort",
