      "name": "UnlockIoHandle",
      "signature": "void UnlockIoHandle(uint dwFileHandle)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Unlocks the critical section for an I/O handle entry.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate table index (dwFileHandle >> 5) and entry offset ((dwFileHandle & 0x1f) * 0x24)\n2. Get pointer to CRITICAL_SECTION at offset 0xc in IoInfo entry\n3. Call LeaveCriticalSection to release the lock\n\nParameters:\n- dwFileHandle (uint): CRT file handle index\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1f (31): Mask for entry index within table (32 entries per table)\n- 0x24 (36): IoInfo structure stride\n- 0xc: Offset of CRITICAL_SECTION in IoInfo structure",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:4ebd25a652d48fc0c3275eab0a712286",
