      "name": "FindFreeBlockInPage",
      "signature": "int FindFreeBlockInPage(int * pPageHeader, uint dwAvailable, uint dwBlockSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Searches for a free block in a small block heap page.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if remaining space at current position can satisfy request\n2. If yes, allocate from current position and update header\n3. If no, scan page for free blocks (marked with 0 bytes)\n4. Count consecutive free bytes until block found or space exhausted\n5. When suitable block found, mark with size and update header\n6. Return computed pointer or 0 if allocation fails\n\nParameters:\n- pPageHeader (int*): Page header with next ptr at [0], remaining at [1], data at [2]\n- dwAvailable (uint): Available space to search before giving up\n- dwBlockSize (uint): Requested block size in bytes\n\nReturns:\n- Computed block pointer on success (data_ptr * 16 - header * 15)\n- 0 on failure (no suitable free block found)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x3E (62): Page header has 0xF8 (248) bytes = 62 dwords for data area\n- 0x8: Block header offset added to get usable data pointer",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:4f3543287939943021eaf1632a1582f1",
