      "name": "FreeSbhRegion",
      "signature": "void FreeSbhRegion(void * * ppRegion)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Frees a Small Block Heap (SBH) region and unlinks it from the region list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. VirtualFree the memory block at ppRegion[4] with MEM_RELEASE (0x8000)\n2. If this region is the list head, update head pointer to next region\n3. If not the sentinel region (g_pSbhRegionHead):\n   a. Unlink from doubly-linked list (prev->next = next, next->prev = prev)\n   b. HeapFree the region structure\n4. If sentinel region, set g_nSbhInitMode to -1 (uninitialized)\n\nParameters:\n- ppRegion (void**): Pointer to SBH region structure (doubly-linked list node)\n  - [0]: pPrev - previous region pointer\n  - [1]: pNext - next region pointer\n  - [4]: pVirtualMem - virtual memory block to free\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6fc48e68: Caller that scans regions and frees empty ones",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:54ffff5ceafbb1247d2270b70dfe4f31",
