      "name": "CompareStringsInsensitive",
      "signature": "int CompareStringsInsensitive(char * pszStr1, char * pszStr2, uint nMaxCount)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Compares two strings case-insensitively up to a maximum count.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return 0 if nMaxCount is 0\n2. If no locale codepage set, compare using ASCII lowercase conversion (A-Z -> a-z)\n3. If locale active, acquire lock and use ToLowerWithLocale for each char comparison\n4. Return 0 if equal, -1 if str1 < str2, 1 if str1 > str2\n\nParameters:\n- pszStr1 (char*): First string to compare\n- pszStr2 (char*): Second string to compare\n- nMaxCount (uint): Maximum characters to compare\n\nReturns:\n- 0: Strings are equal within count\n- -1: pszStr1 < pszStr2\n- 1: pszStr1 > pszStr2\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x41, 0x5a: ASCII 'A' and 'Z' for uppercase range\n- 0x20: Offset to convert uppercase to lowercase\n- 0x13: CRT critical section ID for locale",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
