      "comment": "Formats a path string using sprintf-style formatting with locale substitution.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize format control structure with dest buffer and max length (0x7FFFFFFF)\n2. Call internal sprintf handler to format string with varargs\n3. Decrement remaining length; if overflow, call error handler\n4. Otherwise, null-terminate the output buffer\n\nParameters:\n- szDest (char*): Destination buffer for formatted path\n- szFormat (char*): Format string (e.g., \"data\\\\local\\\\font\\\\%s\\\\default.map\")\n- ... (varargs): Format arguments from caller's stack\n\nReturns:\n- Result from formatter (typically bytes written or -1 on error)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x42 (66): Format control flag ('B' - buffer mode)\n- 0x7FFFFFFF: Maximum buffer length (INT_MAX)",
