      "name": "CleanupCRTResources",
      "signature": "void CleanupCRTResources(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Cleans up CRT resources during DLL detach or process termination.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Deletes all CRT critical sections via DeleteAllCriticalSections\n2. Checks if TLS index is valid (not 0xFFFFFFFF)\n3. If valid, frees the TLS slot and resets index to 0xFFFFFFFF\n\nParameters:\n- None (void function)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- DeleteAllCriticalSections: Frees all CRT synchronization objects\n- CRTDllMainHandler: Calls this on DLL_PROCESS_DETACH",
