      "name": "StrCat",
      "signature": "char * StrCat(char * szDest, char * szSrc)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "char *",
      "comment": "Concatenates source string to end of destination string.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Find null terminator of szDest using DWORD-aligned reads\n2. Copy szSrc to end of szDest using DWORD-aligned copy\n3. Handle unaligned bytes at start/end byte-by-byte\n\nParameters:\n- szDest (char*): Destination buffer, must have room for appended string\n- szSrc (char*): Source string to append\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to szDest\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x7efefeff: Null byte detection magic (finds zero byte in DWORD)\n- 0x81010100: Mask for null byte detection result",
