      "signature": "int EncodeCodepointToUtf8(void * this, uint dwCodepoint)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Encodes a Unicode codepoint into UTF-8 bytes using a lookup table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Mask codepoint to 16-bit value\n2. Iterate through g_pUtf8EncodingTable entries (16 bytes each)\n3. Find entry where codepoint <= max value (offset 0x8)\n4. Extract shift count (offset 0x4) and prefix byte (offset 0x2)\n5. Write first byte: (codepoint >> shift) | prefix\n6. Write continuation bytes: ((codepoint >> (shift-6)) & 0x3F) | 0x80\n7. Repeat step 6 while shift > 0\n\nParameters:\n- this (byte*): Output buffer for UTF-8 bytes (via ECX)\n- dwCodepoint (uint): Unicode codepoint to encode\n\nReturns:\n- Number of bytes written (1-6), or -1 if encoding fails\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x3F (63): Continuation byte mask (6 bits)\n- 0x80 (128): Continuation byte prefix\n- 0x10 (16): Table entry stride in bytes",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:99d33bd25cedc89942d562b8c46fa8b1",
