      "comment": "Cleans up CRT heap resources during DLL detach.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If g_dwHeapMode == 3 (virtual alloc mode):\n   - Loop through heap block array entries\n   - Decommit each block with VirtualFree(MEM_DECOMMIT)\n   - Release each block with VirtualFree(MEM_RELEASE)\n   - Free tracking structure via HeapFree\n   - Free heap block array itself\n2. If g_dwHeapMode == 2 (linked list mode):\n   - Walk circular linked list starting at PTR_LOOP\n   - VirtualFree each allocated region\n3. Destroy the CRT heap handle via HeapDestroy\n\nParameters:\n- None (void function)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x4000: MEM_DECOMMIT flag\n- 0x8000: MEM_RELEASE flag\n- 0x100000: Block size (1MB) for decommit\n- 0x14 (20): Stride of heap block entries\n- 0x10 (16): Offset to allocation pointer in list node",
