      "name": "GetPeLinkerVersion",
      "signature": "void GetPeLinkerVersion(ushort * pwVersion)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Retrieves the PE linker version from the current module's PE header.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize output to 0\n2. Get module handle for current process via GetModuleHandleA(NULL)\n3. Verify DOS header magic (0x5A4D = \"MZ\")\n4. Read PE header offset from DOS header at offset 0x3C\n5. Extract minor version (byte at PE+0x1A) and major version (byte at PE+0x1B)\n6. Store as little-endian ushort (minor in low byte, major in high byte)\n\nParameters:\n- pwVersion (ushort*): Output buffer for linker version (minor | major << 8)\n\nReturns:\n- void: Version stored in output parameter, 0 if PE header invalid\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x5A4D: DOS \"MZ\" header magic\n- 0x3C: Offset to PE header pointer in DOS header\n- 0x1A: Minor linker version offset in PE Optional Header\n- 0x1B: Major linker version offset in PE Optional Header",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:d8be7433da8984a6d08ceacc3367b90b",
