      "name": "FlushAllFileStreams",
      "signature": "int FlushAllFileStreams(int nFlushMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Flushes all open file stream buffers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Lock CRT critical section (index 2)\n2. Iterate through all open FILE streams\n3. For each active stream (flag & 0x83):\n   - Lock the stream\n   - Mode 1: Flush all, count successes\n   - Mode 0: Flush writable (flag & 2), track failures\n   - Unlock the stream\n4. Unlock CRT critical section\n\nParameters:\n- nFlushMode: 1=flush all and count, 0=flush writable only\n\nReturns:\n- Mode 1: Count of successfully flushed streams\n- Mode 0: 0 on success, -1 if any flush failed\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x83: Active stream flags (_IOREAD|_IOWRT|_IORW)\n- 0x02: _IOWRT flag (writable stream)\n- 2: CRT critical section index for I/O",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
