      "name": "fclose",
      "signature": "int fclose(FILE * pStream)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Closes a file stream and releases associated resources.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if stream has _IOSTRG flag (0x40) set indicating string mode\n2. If string mode, clear _flag field and return -1 (EOF)\n3. Otherwise lock file, call __fclose_lk to perform actual close, unlock file\n\nParameters:\n- pStream (FILE*): Pointer to FILE structure to close\n\nReturns:\n- 0 on success, -1 (EOF) on failure or string mode stream",
