      "name": "DoExit",
      "signature": "void DoExit(dword dwExitCode, int nCallAtExitFuncs, int nQuickExit)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "CRT exit handler that terminates the process with optional atexit callback execution.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call cleanup function FUN_6fc44aef\n2. If already exiting (g_dwExitInProgress==1), force terminate via TerminateProcess\n3. Set g_dwExitActive=1, store quick exit flag\n4. If nCallAtExitFuncs==0, walk atexit table backwards calling each registered handler\n5. Execute C++ static destructor terminator arrays\n6. If nQuickExit==0, call ExitProcess; else call FUN_6fc44af8 for cleanup\n\nParameters:\n- dwExitCode (uint): Process exit code passed to ExitProcess/TerminateProcess\n- nCallAtExitFuncs (int): 0=execute atexit handlers, non-zero=skip them\n- nQuickExit (int): 0=normal exit via ExitProcess, non-zero=quick cleanup path\n\nReturns:\n- void (may not return if ExitProcess is called)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
