      "name": "SaveUnwindContext",
      "signature": "void SaveUnwindContext(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Saves exception unwinding context to global storage.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store scope table pointer from [EBP+8] to g_pUnwindScopeTable\n2. Store exception context from EAX to g_pUnwindExceptionContext\n3. Store frame pointer (EBP) to g_pUnwindFramePointer\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: EAX contains exception context pointer\n- IMPLICIT: EBP+8 contains scope table pointer\n\nReturns:\n- void (context saved to global unwind structure)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- __local_unwind2: Calls this to save context before executing unwind handlers",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
