      "name": "ShowMessageBoxWithActiveWindow",
      "signature": "int ShowMessageBoxWithActiveWindow(char * lpszText, char * lpszCaption, uint dwType)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Displays a MessageBox with the active window as parent.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Lazy-load user32.dll if MessageBoxA not resolved\n2. Resolve MessageBoxA, GetActiveWindow, GetLastActivePopup\n3. Get active window handle via GetActiveWindow\n4. Get last active popup of that window via GetLastActivePopup\n5. Call MessageBoxA with resolved parent window\n\nParameters:\n- lpszText (char*): Message text to display\n- lpszCaption (char*): Dialog box title\n- dwType (uint): MessageBox flags (MB_OK, MB_ICONERROR, etc.)\n\nReturns:\n- MessageBox return value (IDOK, IDCANCEL, etc.) or 0 on failure",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
